# The view is asked once whether it is as long as was written, and the length is narrowed at the head of the block behind that question. Where a later read meets the same question already answered, no block
# begins: the length was narrowed again where the read stood, behind other operations of its block, and the verifier stopped the build under check=Validate and in every build with assertions.
# OPTIONS: check=Validate
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: = GetTypedArrayElement {{*}}isInsideView
